        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/ccd318/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-21T12:34:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For quite awhile when i first switch ti vertical storsge, i still used your tuckboxes. I appreciate the work you have done. I have your terrian for tactics printed, and use your simplified hp trackers for sentinels now. I like the concept for the card sized hp trackers, but some of the color choices didnt worj for my bad eyes. Tell tracerbullet i am thankful for the new vertical dividers. Any chance he might do vertical dividers fof the promo characters? I get replacement decks for the promos so i can crazy things like the all legacy battle (america greatest legacy, young legacy and legacy vs iron legacy). Thanks for the work done, and i look foward to the terrain for. Broken city in time.</p>",
