        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/derpthebugbear/{size}/2081_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-22T09:17:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What I've been using for dividers is HikariStarshine's Vertical Dividers (he's on BoardgameGeek): https://boardgamegeek.com/article/18489341#18489341</p><p>They were made with Printer Studio in mind.&nbsp; Print on Tarot sized cards, then cut off black portion on the bottom of each. Works really well for those white BCW boxes.</p><p>He even has dividersfor the promos I believe.&nbsp; He also has dividers for all the Cauldron fan-expansion content, but I haven't really looked into that stuff, and probably wont till after the final SotM expansion anyways.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
