        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/6bbea6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-27T03:55:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For those of you that are crazy like me and keep them in dragon shield sleeves (or other thick sleeves), I have boxes to hold your decks. I have them hosted here for the moment <a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/images/user/1051432/inkomo\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://boardgamegeek.com/images/user/1051432/inkomo </a>. I am currently working on the rest of them, getting clean images of the hero/villain/environment names is what takes the longest. Also images for the hero/environment boxes are taking longer as <a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/multiverse\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/multiverse </a>is not up to date with the current releases (I completely understand for this to be a very low priority). I have templates set up so that once I have what I need, I can complete them fast. I do have a credits listed for anything that is not my original work, so please keep the pdf files as they are if you redistribute them so the original effort done by other people is still acknowledged.</p>",
